{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:245","content":{"id":245,"title":"36 疫苗和人工免疫","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bc8ee0f5-f032-48be-9cc8-55b133b0de3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接种疫苗的历史，几百年前，通过人痘接种，认为诱发免疫力。在一千年前的北宋，从轻微感染者身上取一些痘痂，晾干，磨成粉末，吹入受种痘着鼻孔，一切顺利的情况下，接种人会感染轻度天花，将会就会对重度天花免疫。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1510f689-27f7-4183-9065-4ddcfa1e9ca2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"天花在历史上引起了巨大的灾难，在 20 世纪天花夺走了 3 亿人生命。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e2fc4a06-39fb-4220-9482-ba2e858bdbcf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"疫苗接种真正开启，人们发现没必要使用真正的天花病毒进行接种，使用更安全的牛痘（天花病毒的一种变体，感染对象是牛），就开发出了第一种疫苗，后来天花得到了根除。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"54613100-5e67-436e-a45b-ffae9c6e61e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"生成记忆细胞不简单，要让免疫吸引认为受到了攻击，还不能因为疫苗而感染上这种病。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4da3cbd7-172c-46ed-a51e-069c10135576","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产生免疫力的方法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a03328bf-6b39-4b18-87ea-03f1aacc22db","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c4cfcae8-1151-4a1a-8c01-1adfb355b579","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aa6a0241-0a33-411b-bde5-261e749e1f7f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"被动免疫：从其他幸存者身上获得对某疾病或某病原体的免疫力过程"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f0bbb47d-5f08-4c83-9453-6f876ce11f0c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体不仅能对抗病原体，还能对抗毒素，在微观层面，毒素就是某种分子。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"333297c5-ce1d-43f6-9066-a2d39ca74074","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以毒蛇抗蛇毒血清为例，从毒蛇身上采集毒液，注入马或兔子这些哺乳动物体内，剂量在动物的耐受范围内，让动物产生免疫力，体内就会生成大量抗体，人们采集这些血液，把抗体分离出来，去掉血液其他成分，就得到了抗毒血清。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"04ec39c1-e17d-46c7-a606-419fccef7ffe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"怀孕时某些抗体可以通过胎盘进入胎儿体内，让胎儿获得母体的免疫力，从而获得被动免疫，另外大量抗体还可以通过母乳传给孩子"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c641861-5e0e-4986-94d0-887e7a30a158","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抗体采集也可以从人类身上进行，从血库的捐献血液采集抗体，汇集到一起，在输给免疫缺陷、不能产生抗体的病人"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b1e8db2b-4cf1-4818-80e3-7bcf0f28b4be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"被动免疫的缺点是：效果只是暂时的，没有记忆能力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"78b37d02-743b-4835-84e7-13c18b244200","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bc9fcf36-d9bb-46e8-a8ae-25846e9d191c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主动免疫，生成记忆细胞，为特定病原体做准备"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5544bff4-1812-4c18-b278-e5de8e95ec0d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在不得病的情况下，让身体以为得了病，从而对疾病进行免疫。从安全且充分的触发免疫应答，但同时避免引发真正的疾病。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9f28f222-b7f6-4cf4-8b96-8050070ab090","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一种办法，在某种程度上染上疾病，但是症状很轻，如人痘接种，这就是减毒活疫苗的原理，注射真病原体，但致病性大大减轻，如麻疹疫苗，麻疹病毒经过培养，没什么毒性，但是会引起强烈的免疫应答"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ccd28b79-345d-4d11-b46d-39a1706a0ff6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"活疫苗的缺点，需要在适当温度下储存，也不是所有的病原体都可以制成活疫苗"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2d1e9976-a992-4a35-9cbd-86eff91ab3f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一种办法，注射前直接杀死病原体，叫做灭活疫苗，但是会导致病原体变得太过无害，无法充分激活免疫系统，需要和可以高度激活免疫系统的化学物质混合在一起"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5471f50d-3917-4b44-bb6f-286f3e084e74","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"再一种办法，亚单位疫苗，利用的不是完整的病原体，而是其中的特种部分（抗原），这种方法很安全，这些抗原也需要和激活免疫系统的化学物质混合在一起"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5e2eac20-c66e-4721-b2bc-33562fa07f4e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"新型的 mRNA 疫苗，让人体自身细胞生成抗原，供免疫系统识别，注射 mRNA 后，少数体细胞会生成病毒抗原，免疫系统被激活，发动防御"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fb1ba754-8b3b-42a5-bf3c-766445d81304","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接种疫苗是一种社会责任，如果健康的人都接种疫苗，就能形成群体免疫，可以保护那些无法接种的人。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第三部分，恶意接管"},{"label":"36 疫苗和人工免疫","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:245","type":"doc","id":245}}],"prevPage":{"title":"35 免疫系统是怎样牢记敌人的","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:244","type":"doc","id":244}},"nextPage":{"title":"37 免疫系统太弱：HIV 和艾滋病","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:247","type":"doc","id":247}},"createTime":1741826099783,"updateTime":1743303640528,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640528}}